            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Joshuwa wadzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Aiziraeli hiko mwango wa Ebali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 20:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadzenga viratu Musa mtumishi wa Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyolagiza Aiziraeli, kama vyoandikpwa katika chitabu cha shariya za Musa, kuamba “Dzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka kuhumira mawe ambago tagatsongerwe wala kugutwa na chuma.” Dzulu ya hipho phatu pha kulavira sadaka, amlavira sadaka ya kuochwa na sadaka ya amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshuwa waandika nakala ya shariya za Musa dzulu ya mawe higo mbere za Aiziraeli osi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 11:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.11+DEU.27.12+DEU.27.13+DEU.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27:11–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Aiziraeli osi, enyezi na ajeni phamwenga na vilongozi vyao, atumia na aamuli aima uphande huno na huno kulolana na sanduku ra chilagane mbere za Alawi ambao ni alavyadzi-sadaka ariokala akatsukula sanduku ra chilagane ra Mwenyezi Mlungu. Nusu yao aima mbere ya mwango Gerizimu na nusu yanjina achiima mbere ya mwango Ebali, dza viratu Musa, mtumishi wa Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyolagiza hipho mwandzo kuhusu kujaliwa kpwa Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye Joshuwa wasoma maneno gosi ga shariya, baraka na lana kulengana na gosi goandikpwa kahi ya chitabu cha shariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taphana hata neno mwenga arirolagiza Musa ambaro Joshuwa karisomere mbere za Aiziraeli osi phamwenga na achetu, anache na ajeni osi ariosagala phamwenga nao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
